  "description": "He's mad. Rohshan, abandoning the pride of his Count family and his duty to continue the lineage, is addicted to his relationship with his slave, Kyle. Before the Nest Wedding, the grand finale of this year's Black Dragon Festival, Kyle relentlessly provokes Rohshan into intoxication, desperate to get him to confess. With Rohshan refusing to confess, Kyle loses his reason and goes mad with each passing moment.\n\n *\"How long do I have to wait? If I keep this up, I'll go completely crazy.\"*\n\nSecrets swirl around Rohshan's mansion: the suspicion of his parents' murder, the origins of his lustful nature, the identity of the slave who has captivated him...\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
